(191073,'voice','',NULL,NULL,'','The promise that matters most. Every child checked in. Every child accounted for. Some children ride the bus. Some are dropped off by a parent. Some come with a grandparent or a carpool: a quick text to Tendi checks them in, so the office knows to expect them. However a child arrives, they\'re checked in the moment they\'re here. So the office always sees exactly who has arrived and who is still expected. And if a child who was expected never checks into class, Tendi speaks up, before anyone assumes they simply made it in.','2026-08-31 16:04:38',NULL,NULL),
